#: ../../integration_guides/storage/isilon.rst:7
msgid ""
"Enable insecure mode on the NFS settings.  This allows non-root ports to be "
"used.  Setting the insecure/privileged mode will require a restart of the "
"Isilon nodes."
msgstr ""
"Enable insecure modo on el NFS configuración.  This allows non-root ports to"
" be used.  Setting el insecure/privileged modo será require un restart of el"
" Isilon nodes."

#: ../../integration_guides/storage/isilon.rst:9
#: ../../integration_guides/storage/isilon.rst:44
msgid "Select the Infrastructure link in the navigation bar."
msgstr "Seleccione el Infrastructure link in el navigation bar."

#: ../../integration_guides/storage/isilon.rst:10
#: ../../integration_guides/storage/isilon.rst:45
msgid "Select the Storage link in the sub navigation bar."
msgstr "Seleccione el Storage link in el sub navigation bar."

#: ../../integration_guides/storage/isilon.rst:11
msgid "In the SERVERS tab, Click the :guilabel:`+ ADD` button."
msgstr "En el SERVERS pestaña, Haga clic en el :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR` botón."

#: ../../integration_guides/storage/isilon.rst:12
